DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41696::$$$message_0328_0000_0000$$$::"Congratulations.[br]You've run all the way to the finish line."::
41697::$$$message_0328_0001_0000$$$::"That hot summer afternoon, that freezing rain,[br]and the quiet asphalt in the twilight...[br]They were all uncertain recollections."::
41698::$$$message_0328_0002_0000$$$::"We call these beautiful treasures 'memories.'[br]Well done."::
41699::$$$message_0328_0003_0000$$$::"...Objectively, all you did was mindlessly tap through the game to complete this collection."::
41700::$$$message_0328_0004_0000$$$::"I'll say it as many times as it takes. Congratulations![br][wvl canskip=0 time=400] You'll be fine even without any omikuji."::
41701::$$$message_0328_0005_0000$$$::"You can get by [wvl][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(517,64,255)(517,44,255)(517,57,255)(517,44,255) storage=凛巫女服01b(中) accel=0]on your own, right?[br][wm canskip=0]You won't get anxious, even if you don't [wvl][move textoff=0 time=120 path=(517,64,255)(517,44,255)(517,57,255)(517,44,255) storage=凛巫女服01b(中) accel=0]stack the collected ema[br]next to your pillow and count them every night...right?"[wm canskip=0]::
41702::$$$message_0328_0006_0000$$$::"I'm sure they've realized that there's a way to live without charms and talismans."::
41703::$$$message_0328_0007_0000$$$::"I sure hope so."::
41704::$$$message_0328_0008_0000$$$::"Stop spoiling the moment...[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01g2(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=600][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01g2(中)]Well it's time we got going."::
41705::$$$message_0328_0009_0000$$$::"The next time you're here, I'm sure the cherry blossoms will be in bloom."::
41706::$$$message_0328_0010_0000$$$::"But you'll find it.[br][cacheimage storage=セイバー巫女服01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー巫女服01a(中)]It's a nostalgic sight you've seen before. May your memories with us always be near your heart."::
41707::$$$message_0328_0011_0000$$$::"...Wait, really!?"::
41708::$$$message_0328_0012_0000$$$::"Now, [wvl canskip=0 time=800]it's time to say goodbye."::
41709::$$$message_0328_0013_0000$$$::"Farewell, until the day we meet again."::
41710::$$$message_0328_0014_0000$$$::"Bye."::
41711::$$$message_0328_0015_0000$$$::"I don't quite understand...but there you have it![lr]::
41712::$$$message_0328_0015_0001$$$::Adieu!"::

